.TH "RAPTOR-COMPLETION" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-completion \- Print a completion script for SHELL; e.g. eval "$(raptor completion bash)".
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor completion\fR [\-h] {bash,zsh,fish}
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a completion script for SHELL; e.g. eval "$(raptor completion bash)".
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
